<h1>Michael J. Kelly</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 15th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.kellyfor15.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (kellyfor15.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>His campaign site lists gun violence prevention, lowering healthcare costs including insurance premiums and prescription drugs, equal pay, affordable childcare and paid family leave, school and mental health funding, and support for first responders as priorities.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Chicago Fire Department firefighter and Local 2 union member for about 20 years, and a former coach and athletic director at Saint Edward Elementary School; chairs the House Police and Fire Committee.</p>
